// Syncthing ignore list for the emu-save-dolphin folder.
// Deployed by chezmoi, gated on the `emulation` role.
//
// The folder root is Dolphin's whole flatpak data dir, which holds shader
// caches, dumps and Load/ alongside the actual saves. Only the three save
// directories should cross machines; the rest is large and per-host (and the
// two hosts have different GPUs, so a shared shader cache would be wrong).
//
// Patterns are matched in order and the FIRST match wins, so every include
// must precede the catch-all. Each directory needs two lines: `!/GC` admits
// the directory itself, `!/GC/**` admits its contents -- without the second,
// children fall through to `**` and are excluded while the empty directory
// syncs. That asymmetry is the easy mistake here.

!/GC
!/GC/**
!/Wii
!/Wii/**
!/StateSaves
!/StateSaves/**

// Everything else: Cache/, Dump/, Load/, ShaderCache/, Logs/, config, ...
**
